sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as llm-d-inference-scheduler
    participant Sidecar as Routing Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Prefiller as Remote Prefiller Pod<br/>varies/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8001/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Sidecar: Startup: TLS config loaded<br/>(cert-path or self-signed RSA 4096)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Sidecar,K8sAPI: Background: SSRF Allowlist (when enabled)
        Sidecar->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool CR<br/>SharedInformer, field selector
        K8sAPI-->>Sidecar: InferencePool events<br/>(extract pod label selector)
        Sidecar->>K8sAPI: Watch Pods matching selector<br/>SharedInformer, 30s resync
        K8sAPI-->>Sidecar: Pod events (add/update/delete)
        Note over Sidecar: Rebuild allowlist:<br/>pod IPs + hostnames
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Scheduler,Decoder: Flow 1: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL v2)
        Scheduler->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Header: x-prefiller-host-port<br/>Header: x-request-id
        Note over Sidecar: Generate UUID for correlation<br/>Check SSRF allowlist (if enabled)

        alt SSRF check fails
            Sidecar-->>Scheduler: HTTP 403 Forbidden<br/>prefiller host not in allowlist
        else SSRF check passes or disabled
            Note over Sidecar: PREFILL STAGE
            Sidecar->>Prefiller: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>max_tokens=1, max_completion_tokens=1<br/>stream=false<br/>kv_transfer_params.do_remote_decode=true
            Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Response with populated<br/>kv_transfer_params:<br/>{remote_block_ids, engine_id,<br/>host, port}

            Note over Sidecar: DECODE STAGE
            Sidecar->>Decoder: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Restore original stream/token settings<br/>Inject prefiller kv_transfer_params
            Decoder-->>Sidecar: Inference response<br/>(streaming or non-streaming)
            Sidecar-->>Scheduler: Response forwarded
        end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Scheduler,Decoder: Flow 2: Direct Passthrough (No Prefiller)
        Scheduler->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(no x-prefiller-host-port header)
        Sidecar->>Decoder: Forward request directly<br/>(reverse proxy passthrough)
        Decoder-->>Sidecar: Inference response
        Sidecar-->>Scheduler: Response forwarded
    end
